      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I actively need this for one of my current projects.\n\nCurrently, I have to resort to using physics objects (rigidbodies + constraints) and FinalIK to achieve the appearance of a chain, which is needlessly expensive (both computationally *and* monetarily!) and doesn't even look that good in certain setups.\n\nIf Physbones could declare an end point, this entire problem would be solved as native support for chains/cables/etc. would make that setup obsolete.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
