  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-06T00:37:30.560Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, the only way to manipulate the end of a physbone chain is by grabbing it. It would be nice if we could also parent the end of a chain to another bone in the armature and have it behave the same way. (for instance, you could make a physbone chain that starts at the shoulder and ends at the wrist)",
